# The API image needs `packages/` and nothing else. Everything here is either
# irrelevant to it (the Flutter client, the plans, the emitted artifacts) or
# actively harmful in a build context (node_modules from a different platform,
# a local .env, git history).
*
!packages
packages/**/node_modules
packages/**/dist
packages/**/.env*
packages/**/coverage
packages/**/reports
packages/**/.stryker-tmp
packages/**/tmp
